SUMMARY:[AI ADJUSTED] running — Replace with 30–35 min very easy jog at
  6:45–7:15/km — no in
DESCRIPTION:Replace with 30–35 min very easy jog at 6:45–7:15/km — no
  intervals\; this is race-week prep for Treviso 10K on Oct 10.\n\nReason: 
 Running a hard interval session 4 days before the Treviso 10K risks accumu
 lated leg fatigue and a poor race result\; easy aerobic running keeps legs
  ticking over without adding stress.\n\nAI coaching 2026-10-03
END:VEVENT
