SUMMARY:[AI ADJUSTED] strength training — Reduce to 20–25 min very ligh
 t activation only: bodyweight s
DESCRIPTION:Reduce to 20–25 min very light activation only: bodyweight si
 ngle-leg calf raises\, hip mobility\, and core breathing — skip all heav
 y loading 2 days before Treviso 10K.\n\nReason: Heavy strength work 48 hou
 rs before a race leaves muscles sore and legs heavy\; a brief activation s
 ession maintains neuromuscular readiness without fatigue cost.\n\nAI coach
 ing 2026-10-03
END:VEVENT
