SUMMARY:[AI ADJUSTED] cycling — Skip entirely — no cycling session 2 da
 ys before Treviso 10K
DESCRIPTION:Skip entirely — no cycling session 2 days before Treviso 10K\
 ; legs need to be fully fresh.\n\nReason: Adding a 90-min bike session two
  days out from the 10K race will accumulate residual muscular fatigue that
  compromises race-day running performance.\n\nAI coaching 2026-10-03
END:VEVENT
