DESCRIPTION:Replace with 4×800 m at 5:00–5:15/km with 90-sec jog recover
 y\, total ~45 min — reduced volume as first quality run session in the p
 ost-race recovery week following Treviso.\n\nReason: Jumping straight back
  to 6 reps of hard intervals the Thursday after a 10K race risks overloadi
 ng underdeveloped run fitness\; starting with 4 reps is a safer re-introdu
 ction.\n\nAI coaching 2026-10-03
END:VEVENT
